                    <li><a class="journey-service-link" href="https://rtionline.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Track RTI request status<span class="journey-sr"> (opens the RTI Online portal in a new tab)</span></a></li>
                    <li><a class="journey-service-link" href="https://rtionline.gov.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View the reply to your RTI request<span class="journey-sr"> (opens the RTI Online portal in a new tab)</span></a></li>
                </ul>
                <p class="journey-note">
                    On the RTI Online portal, select Hindustan Copper Limited as the
